{"path":"experimental/fs/space_info","title":"std::experimental::filesystem::space_info","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::filesystem::</span>space_info","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/fs/space_info","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"Represents the filesystem information as determined by space.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/experimental/filesystem\">&lt;experimental/filesystem&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-fs_ts\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> space_info <span class=\"br0\">{</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; uintmax_t capacity<span class=\"sy4\">;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; uintmax_t free<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <br>&nbsp; &nbsp; uintmax_t available<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <br><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-fs-ts t-mark-ts\">(filesystem TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Represents the filesystem information as determined by <a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/fs/space\">space</a>.\n</p><p>The members have the following meaning:\n</p>\n<ul><li> <code>capacity</code> -- total size of the filesystem, in bytes\n</li><li> <code>free</code> -- free space on the filesystem, in bytes\n</li><li> <code>available</code> --  free space available to a non-privileged process (may be equal or less than <code>free</code>)\n</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;experimental/filesystem&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> fs <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">experimental</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">filesystem</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">space_info</span> devi <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">space</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"/dev/null\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">space_info</span> tmpi <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">space</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"/tmp\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"         Capacity         Free    Available<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"/dev:   \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> devi.<span class=\"me1\">capacity</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"   \"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> devi.<span class=\"me1\">free</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"   \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> devi.<span class=\"me1\">available</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"/tmp: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> tmpi.<span class=\"me1\">capacity</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> tmpi.<span class=\"me1\">free</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> tmpi.<span class=\"me1\">available</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>\n          Capacity         Free    Available\n/dev:   4175114240   4175110144   4175110144\n/tmp: 420651237376 411962273792 390570749952</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/fs/space\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>space</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  determines available free space on the file system <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"experimental","title":"Experimental C++ Features"},{"path":"experimental/fs","title":"Filesystem library"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::experimental::filesystem::space_info","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Represents the filesystem information as determined by space."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"space","note":"determines available free space on the file system"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":150,"codeBlockCount":2}
